comments.body:
@Harvard PhD I too write alot by hand. I love it. But a few years ago I -who started work at a student newspaper at a Big Ten university when typewriters were all there was, copy was typed on yellow newsprint and edited w a grease pencil- saw and acquired a typewriter. 

It felt like coming home. 

Laptops are soulless compared to that self-confirming rat-a-tat tat that sends all my synapses into song, and calls the words up from the dusty corners of my cranium. Ding!
